Webster's Unabridged Dictionary, 1913 edition (Anagram word list)
    The Anagram word list, engine/games/anagram/dictionary.txt, is not
    distributed with this software: scripts/download_words.py downloads OPTED
    and recreates it, and building the engine embeds it. It is a subset of the
    headwords of OPTED,
    The Online Plain Text English Dictionary by Ralph Sutherland
    (https://www.mso.anu.edu.au/~ralph/OPTED/), which is based on the Project
    Gutenberg eBook of Webster's Unabridged Dictionary
    (https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/29765), in turn based on the 1913 edition
    of Webster's Unabridged Dictionary. The content is in the public domain; as
    OPTED asks, it remains free and in plain text, and OPTED, Project Gutenberg
    and the 1913 Webster's Unabridged Dictionary are acknowledged here. See
    engine/games/anagram/SOURCE.md.
